 _Rank←{
⍝  ⍺: search terms       :: simple character matrix
⍝  ⍵: BM25F score matrix :: simple numeric matrix ⍴(≢documents) × (≢terms)
⍝ ⍺⍺: hashed lookup into index terms :: derived function
⍝  ←: Indices of rows in results
⍝    Only results which contain at least one instance of one of the search terms
⍝    Ranked descending BM25F (see QUERY.BuildCache)
     0∊⍴⍺:⍳≢⍵   ⍝ No search terms provided, return all results
     terms←⍺ ⋄ BM25F←⍵
     Lookup←⍺⍺
     score←+/(BM25F,0)[;Lookup terms]
     order/⍨0<score[order←⍒score]
 }
